  <div class="nf-journey-intro">
    <span class="feature-detail-number">06 / LEARNING JOURNEY &amp; CONVERSION STRATEGY</span>
    <h2>From Discovery to Informed Action</h2>
    <p>To support prospective clients evaluating Neurofit's digital rehabilitation solutions, I designed a learning-oriented experience connecting product discovery on the homepage with audience-specific benefits and reporting workflows on the Insurers &amp; TPAs page.</p>
    <p>The proposed journey supports different levels of decision readiness rather than requiring visitors to follow a fixed sequence.</p>
  </div>
