    </div>
    <div class="nf-journey-annotation">
      <span class="nf-journey-label">01 / DISCOVER</span>
      <h4>Establish product understanding within seconds</h4>
      <p>The homepage was designed to help first-time visitors quickly understand what Neurofit is, who it serves, and the value it offers. A concise value proposition and real-life simulation preview aim to encourage further exploration and engagement.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="nf-journey-row">
    <div class="nf-journey-media">
