      <figure><img src="/assets/images/Neurofit/Journey_04_Insurer_Benefits.png" alt="Insurers &amp; TPAs — proposed benefits" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Insurers &amp; TPAs — proposed benefits</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
    <div class="nf-journey-annotation">
      <span class="nf-journey-label">02 / EXPLORE</span>
      <h4>Connect capabilities to professional needs</h4>
      <p>Tabbed benefits introduce product capabilities without presenting everything at once. The dedicated insurer page then reframes the offering around cognitive readiness, claim-ready reporting, and return-to-work decisions.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="nf-journey-row">
    <div class="nf-journey-media">
      <figure><img src="/assets/images/Neurofit/Journey_05_Reporting_Workflow.png" alt="Insurers &amp; TPAs — reporting workflow" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Insurers &amp; TPAs — reporting workflow</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/assets/images/Neurofit/Journey_06_Use_Cases_and_Testimonials.png" alt="Insurers &amp; TPAs — use cases and testimonial layout" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Insurers &amp; TPAs — use cases and testimonial layout</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
    <div class="nf-journey-annotation">
      <span class="nf-journey-label">03 / BUILD CONFIDENCE</span>
      <h4>Make the workflow tangible</h4>
      <p>A step-by-step reporting demonstration connects patient activity, performance data, clinical reports, and return-to-work decisions. Expandable use cases and proposed testimonial content offer additional context for evaluation.</p>
    </div>
