    </div>
    <div class="nf-journey-annotation">
      <span class="nf-journey-label">04 / TAKE ACTION</span>
      <h4>Support different levels of readiness</h4>
      <p>The final calls to action let visitors continue learning through case studies or proceed to free sign-up. Earlier sign-up options also support visitors who are already ready to act.</p>
    </div>
