  <div class="nf-journey-measurement">
    <h3>Proposed performance measurement</h3>
    <p>After implementation, monitor GA4 engagement rate and instrument key CTA clicks with event tracking. Compare interactions by CTA type, page and placement, and track completed free sign-ups separately where technically feasible. Assess first-impression comprehension through short user tests rather than inferring understanding from engagement alone.</p>
  </div>
